From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] PackageInstaller: the rule under a header is two pixels

Measured on the device on 2026-10-27, on V89, by scanning the rows of a raw
framebuffer grab: the black rule that patch 0004 puts under the header is **one** row
of pixels, not the two the design asks for (docs/design/eink-ui.md rule 3,
"1dp, which is 2 px on this panel").

The cause is in how the two kinds of width are read. A `<stroke>` width goes
through `getDimensionPixelSize()`, which rounds: 1dp x 1.875 = 1.875 becomes
2 px, which is why patch 0004's card outlines are 2 px. A layer-list item's
inset goes through `getDimensionPixelOffset()`, which truncates, so the same
1dp becomes 1 px (LayerDrawable.java, updateLayerFromTypedArray).

So the inset is named in whole pixels instead. This panel has one density and
the design document already states the value as 2 px, so there is nothing for
a dp to be independent of here. The stroke width keeps its dp: it rounds
correctly, and the two are checked against each other by both being 2.

--- a/res/values/pw3_eink.xml
+++ b/res/values/pw3_eink.xml
@@ -5,4 +5,11 @@
     <color name="pw3_outline">#ff000000</color>
     <!-- 2 px on PW3 (density 1.875, rounded to whole pixels). -->
     <dimen name="pw3_outline_width">1dp</dimen>
+    <!-- The same width again, in whole pixels, for a layer-list inset. An
+         inset is read with getDimensionPixelOffset(), which truncates:
+         1dp x 1.875 is 1.875 and becomes 1 px, where a stroke is read with
+         getDimensionPixelSize(), rounds, and becomes 2. Measured on the device
+         on 2026-10-27: the rule under a title bar was one row of black.
+         Density on this panel is fixed, so the pixels can be named. -->
+    <dimen name="pw3_rule_inset">2px</dimen>
 </resources>
--- a/res/drawable/pw3_bottom_rule.xml
+++ b/res/drawable/pw3_bottom_rule.xml
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@
             <solid android:color="@color/pw3_outline" />
         </shape>
     </item>
-    <item android:bottom="@dimen/pw3_outline_width">
+    <item android:bottom="@dimen/pw3_rule_inset">
         <shape android:shape="rectangle">
             <solid android:color="?android:attr/colorPrimary" />
         </shape>
